; tags.journal — fixture for Stage C Phase 6 tag: query-matching tests
; (dev-docs/planning/core-redefinition/23-tag-query-matching-design.md,
; 24-tag-query-matching-implementation-plan.md). Deliberately mirrors the
; design document's own §2.7 precedence fixture: a "rate" tag declared,
; with a DIFFERENT value, at every one of the four effective-tag sources
; (account-inherited, commodity-propagated, posting-own, transaction-
; header), so a naive "highest-priority wins" implementation would fail
; tests that expect every value to remain independently matchable
; (union-not-shadowing, design §2.7).
;
; Sources and their "rate" value:
;   account-inherited (assets:bank, incl. descendants)  rate:3
;   commodity-propagated ($)                             rate:2
;   posting-own (first transaction's assets:bank posting) rate:1
;   transaction-header (first transaction)                rate:4
;   posting-own, sibling transaction, same account         rate:5
;   posting-own, child account (assets:bank:savings)       rate:6

account assets:bank  ; rate:3, asrc:1
    ; more:info

account assets:bank:savings

commodity $  ; rate:2, csrc:1
    ; extra:tag

2024-01-01 Opening balance  ; rate:4, hsrc:1
    assets:bank               $1000.00  ; rate:1, psrc:1
    equity:opening-balances  $-1000.00

2024-01-05 Sibling transaction, same account, different posting-own rate
    assets:bank                 $50.00  ; rate:5
    equity:opening-balances    $-50.00

2024-01-10 Child account posting, own tag plus inherited parent tag
    assets:bank:savings         $20.00  ; rate:6
    equity:opening-balances    $-20.00

2024-01-15 Commodity tag on an account with no account-level tag
    expenses:misc                $30.00
    equity:opening-balances     $-30.00
